{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","舞动生息"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","ハッピーダンス"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对范围内友军施加强化，并进行治疗。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","範囲内の味方を強化して回復"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个方向，为面前3格扇形范围内的友军恢复-300% − 30% ATK的生命值，并在该区域内施加元气魔法，使其中的友军提升12%攻击力，持续8秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","発動方向を選択し、前方3マスの扇状範囲内の味方のHPを-300% − 30% ATK回復する。さらに元気の魔法を発動し、範囲内にいる味方の攻撃力+12%、8秒持続"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":32,"end":38,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":27,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","持续时间延长至9秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","持続時間が9秒にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","使范围内的友军提升14%攻击力。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","範囲内の味方の攻撃力上昇量が14%にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","范围内的友军还会提升15点攻击速度。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","さらに範囲内の味方の攻撃速度+15"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","持续时间延长至10秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","持続時間が10秒にUP"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","宝石愈疗"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","クリスタルヒール"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一名友军施加持续治疗。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","味方1体に持続的な回復効果を与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","为最虚弱的1名友方英雄施加治愈法术，使该英雄在接下来的4 + 1.5秒内每秒恢复50% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","最も弱っている味方英雄1体に治療術を発動し、4 + 1.5秒間、その英雄のHPが毎秒50% ATK回復"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n